  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "Toucan-1.5M",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\ud83e\udda4 Toucan-1.5M:\n\t\n\nToucan-1.5M is the largest fully synthetic tool-agent dataset to date, designed to advance tool use in agentic LLMs. It comprises over 1.5 million trajectories synthesized from 495 real-world Model Context Protocols (MCPs) spanning 2,000+ tools. By leveraging authentic MCP environments, Toucan-1.5M generates diverse, realistic, and challenging tasks requires using multiple tools, with trajectories involving real tool executions across multi-round, multi-turn\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Agent-Ark/Toucan-1.5M.",
